  "description": "<p>Look sharp and stay warm in Rothco&rsquo;s Navy Emblem Pullover Hooded Sweatshirt &ndash; the ultimate insignia hoodie. This pullover hoodie features a large classic embroidered US Navy emblem on the front chest and a stylish US Navy Anchor embroidered on the left sleeve. The super soft polyester composition and insulating lining make this a warm and comfortable hoodie that you can wear in the cold. The pullover hooded sweatshirt features Rothco&rsquo;s standard drawstring hood and kangaroo pocket. This insignia hoodie is perfect for soldiers, veterans, their families, or anybody who wants to showcase their support for the US Navy.</p>",
